      "value": "@{60ddcbb6e920e2339db9698a|full_name}: I've never seen it before. My main concern is the uncompressed size for Mobile and even though you're under the limits for file size, the 'you ran out of RAM' issue would be easier to diagnose if this was represented a bit clearer than it is now.",
